<title>CHINA: Tata Engineering &amp; Locomotive sets US$200 mln bond.</title>
<headline>Tata Engineering &amp; Locomotive sets US$200 mln bond.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tata Engineering and Locomotive Co (Telco) has launched a US$200 million 144a bond into the U.S., bankers said on Friday.</p>
<p>The 7.875 percent 10-year bond was priced and re-offered at 99.598 to yield 168 basis points over comparable Treasuries.</p>
<p>JP Morgan and Credit Suisse First Boston were joint lead managers.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843-6371</p>
